  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) package spaghetti",
    "1 pound lean ground beef",
    "1 (16 ounce) jar spaghetti sauce",
    "0.5 cup butter, sliced - divided",
    "1 (8 ounce) container cottage cheese",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.25 cup sour cream",
    "1 (8 ounce) package shredded sharp Cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yNdk3wmDEiSy_YnUNlWYMHMYyfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step1-3x4-2522-7cb2fbcd557a4d36b0120fb023472f47.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook spaghetti in boiling water until cooked through but firm to the bite, about 8 to 12 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MRcDSbVU0tXvMLBt8bmb88oEKXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step2-3x4-2536-9c56a3ff5bf74a93a57ba403d9b877cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes; drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OK_kph7HyjHB4-54vlkznez-zoU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step3-3x4-2530-eec8f32ba5154c83bd7c421e7f8c2aeb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a bowl and mix in spaghetti sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xBSNBNnkoq_JTsehFJllt1GqYUM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step4-3x4-2532-7608bc689b5d4a79ba11343147242a4e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1/2 of the butter slices into the bottom of a 9x13-inch casserole dish. Spread 1/2 of the spaghetti into the dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Or_Ar9z6K3IdaqGS2hT8XXL47M8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step6-3x4-2537-c9e7b99f778546089479064cb27287dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cottage cheese, cream cheese, and sour cream together in a bowl; spread mixture over spaghetti.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_wf-9ABYTdU8D0-iee_jbKhc5VU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step8-3x4-2539-841f31838712406da3585054d232cff7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with remaining spaghetti and top with remaining slices of butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yIE2i6L4FFiPhSHkAZ39RGLDkwE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step9-3x4-2541-1f263921968d4385ae57187126506202.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour ground beef mixture over spaghetti and spread in an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LRODL7vu38Q0GYNY7OVEnDYFLdY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step10-3x4-2542-c6cf33856ea34ea896ab1598f57e4975.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 30 minutes. Spread Cheddar cheese on top and continue baking until cheese has melted and is lightly browned, about 15 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aSLTC8W-DWMOKH6qSQVfIv8c2IE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-step12-3x4-2580-b715bc72a58c4ce7bd61aacb857afaf1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232227/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RGABMQkRRGnQWeMROxPibZPyZXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-232227-million-dollar-spaghetti-ddmfs-3x4-2595-9369a8f12fa14516bb494330cb7a4051.jpg"
